+
+config DUST_ECAT_INPUT_LATE_REFRESH
+    bool "Refresh pending CAN feedback once immediately before input mapping"
+    depends on !DUST_ECAT_INPUT_WRITE_COALESCE
+    default n
+    help
+      In Active FreeRun thread context, check CAN receive generation once before
+      copying the next SSC input image. A new snapshot rebuilds only CAN/status
+      fields and preserves the last UART image and window cursor. No recursive
+      mapping or extra ESC write is performed. Experimental until board validation.
+
+config DUST_ECAT_CAN_RX_NOTIFY_FAST
+    bool "Use atomic receive-version hint for the late mapping checkpoint"
+    depends on DUST_ECAT_INPUT_LATE_REFRESH && DUST_ECAT_CAN_RX_THREAD
+    default n
+    help
+      The late checkpoint compares an atomic worker notification version with
+      the version observed under the capture mutex. No change avoids the late
+      mutex/time/trace work. Existing regular SSC receive service and capture
+      expiry checks remain unconditional; this hint is not an expiry validator.
+
+config DUST_ECAT_SM_SYNC
+    bool "Lab: SM2 synchronized publication in SSC owner thread"
+    depends on DUST_ECAT_CAN_RX_THREAD
